# Vector-2D: a 2-component 32-bit-float vector. Pure float math. `plus` / `minus` combine, `scale` by a scalar, `dot` is the scalar product, `cross` the scalar (z-component) cross product, `length` the magnitude, `normalize` the unit vector, `distance` the gap.

load @term/base/code/float
  find square-root

form vector-2
  link x, like decimal
  link y, like decimal

  task plus
    take self
    take other, like vector-2
    like vector-2
    send back
      make vector-2
        bind x
          call add
            read self/x
            read other/x
        bind y
          call add
            read self/y
            read other/y

  task minus
    take self
    take other, like vector-2
    like vector-2
    send back
      make vector-2
        bind x
          call subtract
            read self/x
            read other/x
        bind y
          call subtract
            read self/y
            read other/y

  task scale
    take self
    take factor, like decimal
    like vector-2
    send back
      make vector-2
        bind x
          call multiply
            read self/x
            read factor
        bind y
          call multiply
            read self/y
            read factor

  task dot
    take self
    take other, like vector-2
    like decimal
    send back
      call add
        call multiply
          read self/x
          read other/x
        call multiply
          read self/y
          read other/y

  task cross
    take self
    take other, like vector-2
    like decimal
    send back
      call subtract
        call multiply
          read self/x
          read other/y
        call multiply
          read self/y
          read other/x

  task length
    take self
    like decimal
    send back
      call square-root
        call dot
          read self
          read self

  task normalize
    take self
    like vector-2
    save magnitude
      call length
        read self
    send back
      make vector-2
        bind x
          call divide
            read self/x
            read magnitude
        bind y
          call divide
            read self/y
            read magnitude

  task distance
    take self
    take other, like vector-2
    like decimal
    send back
      call length
        call minus
          read self
          read other

task make-vector-2
  take x, like decimal
  take y, like decimal
  like vector-2
  send back
    make vector-2
      bind x, read x
      bind y, read y
